        prompts: {
          human: "Welcome to Flower & Scorpion, the desert caravan game. Roll the dice to set the Flower and Scorpion for this round. Match dominoes to the caravan, score points for pairs, and hit the Flower for bonuses. Avoid the Scorpion's sting. First to empty your hand wins the round.",
          ai: 'Game: Flower & Scorpion (Bergen domino variant with dice). Setup: Double-six dominoes (28 tiles), 2-4 players, 5-6 tiles dealt per player. Roll phase: Caravan Master rolls dice to determine Flower (bonus) and Scorpion (penalty) values. Play phase: Players match domino ends to the Caravan line. Scoring: +2 for pair match, +3 for triple, +1 if end matches Flower number, -1 if end matches Scorpion number. Win: First to exhaust hand (domino). Draw: One tile from Oasis if no legal play exists.',
        },
